{
    "name": "戶外活動",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，<br>討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！"
            },
            {
                "text": "Kacaw pilipayan no dafak, o tatalacowa kiso saw?",
                "textCh": "Kacaw，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65589/917852",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "O tatayra kako aci Osay i talawadaw mi ’id’id to titi, kiso i?",
                "textCh": "我明天要和Osay去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65589/917853",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Kafangcalan a misalama tengilen! a:ri manga’ay kako tayra mihakelong?",
                "textCh": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65589/917854",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "liclicen ho ci ina iso!",
                "textCh": "你先問媽媽！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65589/917855",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Ina, manga’ay kako mihakelong ci kakaan tayra i talawadaw?",
                "textCh": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？ ",
                "sound": "text/sound/65589/917856",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "nga’ayto nikaorira pina’on kamo haw!",
                "textCh": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
                "sound": "text/sound/71667/998368",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-3.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Aka ka sida’it, cakaeca minaon to kami!",
                "textCh": "沒問題，我們一定會的！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65589/917858",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            }
        ],
        "phase2": {
